                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Current contract = the latest month's Procore prime contract value, every prime contract on the project added together (one Procore project can hold several - landlord / tenant splits). Billed to date = the latest Procore owner pay app's completed and stored (gross of retainage), or Sage invoices where there is no pay app. Backlog = current contract - billed to date. Change orders are Procore prime change orders.",
